{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf2 Magnecube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magnecube</strong> is a 2D puzzle game where you control a magnetic cube that must navigate levels filled with obstacles and unique mechanics. With an integrated level editor, you can create and share your own challenges with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging levels</strong>: Each designed to test your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ innovative mechanics</strong>: From magnets to moving platforms, each level introduces new elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Colorful pixel-art style</strong>: A retro aesthetic that complements the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level editor</strong>: Create, share, and play levels made by other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story mode and online multiplayer</strong>: Explore  levels created by the creator itself or play community-designed levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca1 Why Play Magnecube?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy puzzle and platforming games with a unique twist, <i>Magnecube</i> offers an engaging and creative experience. Its magnetic mechanics and level design will keep you entertained for hours.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fly me to the moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737600/46066686583b46be23b5462b780aa8f41ff30130.jpg"},{"name":"Brain lag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737600/e8db410c639cadb2119dae3211279bde2a452c01.jpg"},{"name":"Thinking in circles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3737600/31f5986838bebb51b564428058f024076979203d.jpg"},{"name":"Slow cooker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3